    "detailed_description": "Fullback Simulator is an ultra-realistic simulator of the fullback role in American football \u2026 no, not really.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game, born to relax its developer between lines of code, aims to relax the player while stimulating his reflexes and tactical foresight along an infinite football field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave fun customizing your fullback, giving him physical characteristics, and then improving him over time, game after game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSprint, dodge, jump, headbutt your opponents, and earn the Beast Mode to break through any defense!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter the first 300 yards, the only thought on your mind is going to be: &quot;Come on, another ten yards... just ten more yards!&quot;",
